Python 3, the language runtime that meson and the mesa build scripts need. A minimal
build: shared libpython, system expat and libffi, no OpenSSL, sqlite, readline or tk,
and no pip (ensurepip is off). Installs python3, a python symlink and the standard
library under /usr/local.
upstream: https://www.python.org/
